  Technological Tapulations trace their tip taps and thumping thwaps through the reverberant rooms of the Bugle. The mellophone mainframe commences its initial intonations, bubbling with boisterous pips and blips. Short stroke keys and spiccato sequences sequestered in consummate consoles call out to the cosmic currents with their superlative circuits.

